## Acknowledgments

The learning-loop concept — log mistakes, dedupe by key, promote recurring
patterns — draws inspiration from the self-improving-agent approach shared
in the open-source community (e.g.
[pskoett/self-improving-agent](https://github.com/pskoett/self-improving-agent)).
This repository is an independent implementation: no upstream code, wording,
or assets are included, and this MIT license covers all original
contributions.

Learnings users generate with this skill are their own data and are not
covered by this repository's license.

## Acknowledgments

This skill is an independent implementation written for the Hermes agent ecosystem.

Learnings and scan results generated with this skill are the user's own data and are not covered by this repository's license.
